# sm001, the beekeeper's stones (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of cty_ada_coalstack, ported. She keeps bees at
# Heatherside now (the table said Mossbank).
mantle sm001
state ready
dialect southmeadow
accent light
tier standard
written_for cty_ada_coalstack
title the beekeeper's stones
fits stage=adult|old
traits humour=dry honesty=sly
quirk collects_smooth_stones_from_the_riverbanks
likes smooth_stones
dislikes grand_promises
fears being_overlooked
hopes sound_hives
topics harvest +.4 land +.2
styles tease=dry
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# farms and keeps bees: dry at the edges, sly in her honesty, and she gathers smooth stones from riverbanks.

words
saying! = A field remembers every pawprint | No hive thrives on boasting
oath! = By the river's patience | Comb and clover
refuse = The fur stays dry

rule @hives
when concept=bark working=yes self.job=farmer
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Mind the hive; honey rewards patience, not swagger. | The bees are cross today. So am I.

rule @stones
when concept=bark working=no
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Set the stones by the door. They've earned their place. | The hive is quiet. Better company than most.

scene stones
when concept=talk.smalltalk
does give.opinion / agree
a : Smooth stones tell the truth: water wears down every grand claim.
b[old] : I've watched it happen.
b : Given long enough.

line greet.return : #greet#. Keep your paws clear of the hives.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Well, there's a thing.
line react.news.known : I'd heard. Bees hear everything.
line answer.how : Hives are sound. That's most of it.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. Come to trade, or come to look?
